title = "Something Is Assembling"
priority = 84
lede = "The watch on the East Wall have stopped counting them individually."
body = "Pressure on the wall is at {threat_pressure} and the thing about that number is that it has been climbing every night rather than oscillating. Whatever is out there is not wandering in. It is being brought.

There are {turrets} guns on the wall and {turret_uptime} of them have heat enough to fire. Both of those numbers are decisions somebody took days ago."
